{
  "name": "@godcreator02/gwb-cli",
  "version": "0.0.3",
  "description": "命令总线：件把能力登记成一条命令，界面、命令行、agent 都经这一份注册表派发",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src"
  ],
  "gwb": {
    "title": "命令总线"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json"
  },
  "//deps": "运行时依赖一条都没有——产物里零 import。但契约包走 peer：GwbCli.run 回的是 GwbResult，它出现在**导出的类型**里，消费方装了这个件之后必须解析得到。cordis 只在 apply 的参数类型里用、不出现在导出面，所以是 dev。三档判据见内核仓 CLAUDE.md",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@godcreator02/gwb-plugin-api": ">=0.0.2"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@godcreator02/gwb-plugin-api": "0.0.2",
    "cordis": "4.0.0-rc.9",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  }
}
